Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 02:35:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Keep original descriptors for nested stdin
 provenance

Carry views enumerate possible file inputs, not reaching-definition proofs. Preserve original fd copies at both nested-shell consumers so main retains unknown-scope refusal and capture-time variable bindings. Ordinary script walks still use carry.

Proof: main baseline 743 tests pass; rebased candidate 7 integration failures; fixed focused set 897 passes. Added group/feed boundary controls (840 related tests pass); always/never carry and both nested consumer mutants killed. Full final-head cron and frozen real-input replay remain required before landing.
