 cron/lifecycle_guard_nested_shells.py         |  8 ++++++--
 ...t_lifecycle_guard_descriptor_provenance.py | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 30 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/cron/test_lifecycle_guard_descriptor_provenance.py

